    "field": "Arctic cloud and climate research",
    "problem": "Accurately projecting Arctic warming is challenged by climate models' disagreement on the role of clouds and their feedbacks, a problem exacerbated by the difficulty of using observations to isolate cloud effects and robustly constrain and improve the models.",
    "method": "This paper proposes a \u201ctwo-way street\u201d approach that integrates advanced satellite observations with climate models, using simulators for fair comparison, to improve the understanding and representation of Arctic clouds.",
    "task": "The task is to review recent advances in Arctic cloud and climate research, summarizing progress in scientific understanding made possible by new satellite observations and climate models.",
