            "target_entity_instance": "atmos",
            "target_entity_type": "Realm",
            "paragraph": "Figure 5 shows an example of the value of the CALIPSO simulator [63] when evaluating Arctic clouds in the Community Atmosphere Model version 5 (CAM5) [67].",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
